#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:62
msgid ""
"The remainder of this section explains these steps in greater detail, first,"
" by describing the components in the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog"
" and, then, by explaining each of the steps above in greater detail."
msgstr ""
"I resten av avsnittet går vi igenom stegen mer ingående. Först beskrivs "
"delarna i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>, därefter förklaras "
"vart och ett av stegen ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:73
msgid "Using the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog."
msgstr "Använda dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:76
msgid ""
"Opening a file into a workbook is a relatively simple process. The only "
"complications come from using the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog to"
" find the desired file, from changing the automatic file format type "
"recognition system, or from specifying a different character encoding than "
"that chosen by <application>Gnumeric</application>. The first of these steps"
" will become intuitive once the user understands the functioning of the "
"dialog. The latter two steps are generally unnecessary and can be ignored by"
" most users."
msgstr ""
"Det är relativt enkelt att öppna en fil i en arbetsbok. Det kan bli mer "
"komplicerat om du behöver leta upp filen i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna "
"fil</interface>, ändra den automatiska identifieringen av filformat eller "
"ange en annan teckenkodning än den <application>Gnumeric</application> har "
"valt. Det första momentet blir enkelt när du har lärt dig hur dialogrutan "
"fungerar. De två senare behövs i regel inte och kan hoppas över."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:88
msgid ""
"The next section explains in detail the different components of the "
"<interface>File Open</interface> dialog and the subsequent section describes"
" each step in the process of opening a file."
msgstr ""
"Nästa avsnitt beskriver dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> och "
"dess olika delar i detalj. Avsnittet därefter går igenom varje steg när du "
"öppnar en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:95
msgid "The components of the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> och dess delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:99
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog allows the user to open an "
"existing file into a <application>Gnumeric</application> workbook but "
"requires that the user find the folder containing the file, select the file,"
" and optionally define a file format type and a character encoding. The "
"dialog also allows the user to change the list of bookmark folders to "
"quickly access different parts of the file system."
msgstr ""
"I dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> kan du öppna en befintlig fil"
" i en arbetsbok i <application>Gnumeric</application>. Du behöver leta upp "
"mappen som innehåller filen och markera den, och kan vid behov ange "
"filformat och teckenkodning. Du kan också ändra listan med bokmärkesmappar "
"för att snabbt komma åt olika delar av filsystemet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:109
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog first appears as is shown in "
"<xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> which also shows a label"
" for each different component of the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> visas först som i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/>, där även varje del av "
"dialogrutan är märkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:117
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog with the component areas "
"labeled."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> med de olika områdena märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:128
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the 'File Open' dialog with the different areas "
"labeled."
msgstr ""
"Den här skärmbilden visar dialogrutan ”Öppna fil” med de olika områdena "
"märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:134
msgid ""
"The different components of the <interface>File Open</interface> dialog, "
"shaded with boxes of different colors and labeled with a letter."
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna i dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface>, markerade "
"med olikfärgade rutor och bokstäver."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:150
msgid "The components of the dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutans delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:153
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> - The starting folder selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> – Området där startmappen väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:159
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to begin navigating the filesystem by choosing a "
"starting folder. The navigation system in this dialog only allows users to "
"select sub-folders of this starting folder so the starting folder must "
"contain the desired file, possibly nested in one or more sub-folders."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du börja navigera i filsystemet genom att välja en startmapp. I "
"dialogrutan kan du bara välja undermappar till den mappen, så startmappen "
"måste innehålla filen du söker, eventuellt i en eller flera undermappar."
